WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.209
In the SEAL teams, 

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:04.295
there’s no training of how to 
report your chief for war crimes.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.756
There’s no way that I 
could live with myself 

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:08.800
had I not gone forward and

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.927
said what I saw.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:16.474
I’m willing to put my life in 
danger to get the job done.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.687
It came over the radio, there 
was a wounded prisoner.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.398
Eddie said, nobody touch him, 
he’s all mine.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:25.650
Did you actually see it happen?

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.609
Yeah. I saw it happen.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.738
This is the most disgraceful day
I've ever seen in my life.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.407
I thought I was going to be in trouble
just for being there.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:39.956
Did you ever intentionally 
shoot any unarmed civilian?

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:40.999
No.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:44.085
Did you ever try to kill an 
unarmed teenage boy?

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:45.044
No.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.297
Do you remember ever
shooting a little girl?

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:48.798
No.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:53.595
It’s a very rare occurrence that
seals are going against one of their own.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:57.140
There is a huge mistake going on here.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.268
Everyone was covering their
tail from the top down.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:03.229
The debate wasn’t,
did Eddie kill a prisoner? 

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.399
The debate was, Eddie killed a
prisoner but is that okay?

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.027
They have no evidence, no proof.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:15.909
Every man, woman and child
that came into his line of sight, 

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.035
he tried to kill them.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.995
No. That didn’t happen.

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.873
You’re making it up.

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:25.293
I hate Eddie but what 
you’re doing is lying.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.464
I should not be on trial
for murder. It is war.

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:33.218
I don’t think they
were prepared for...

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:37.222
this giant bombshell
in the court room.

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:42.519
I’m innocent.
I love you.

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:43.520
Hi sweetheart!

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.690
There’s a line in the sand now.

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:51.736
Unfortunately, the truth is not perfect.

